D-LOADFAT: every FAT-copy-0 sector read during a disk LOAD of a 13-cluster program,
with its caller (the nearest symbol below the return address) and the buffer.
chain from cluster 2:
    sector 1 -> FAT_DBUF from fat_geom_read
    sector 1 -> FAT_MBUF from fnc_read
chain from cluster 338:
    sector 1 -> FAT_DBUF from fat_geom_read
    sector 1 -> FAT_MBUF from fnc_read
    sector 2 -> FAT_DBUF from fnc_straddle
    sector 2 -> FAT_MBUF from fnc_read
